      "content": "i get the need for research and all that, but we're on a tight deadline here and need to start prototyping localized versions. i can't wait for a full research cycle to decide on the initial look and feel.\n\ncan u just give me some educated guesses or design directions based on those specific profiles? like, for liam, yuki, amara, and omar—what kind of color palettes, typography, or even 'vibe' (e.g. minimalist vs decorative) would you suggest for each to make them feel at home? just give me some starting points for the design team.",
